WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.292 --> 00:00:01.960
Louisville police
shot and

00:00:01.960 --> 00:00:02.919
killed Breonna Taylor.

00:00:02.919 --> 00:00:05.338
The deadly shooting
of Philando Castile.

00:00:05.338 --> 00:00:06.548
Stephon Clark
killed by police.

00:00:06.548 --> 00:00:07.966
Fifty shots.

00:00:07.966 --> 00:00:09.384
Six officers opened fire.

00:00:09.384 --> 00:00:10.385
George Floyd!

00:00:10.385 --> 00:00:12.178
Around the United States
there is outrage. 

00:00:15.223 --> 00:00:16.349
Enough is enough,

00:00:16.349 --> 00:00:17.642
but it's been enough. 

00:00:19.936 --> 00:00:22.439
Black communities
have a deep rooted fear

00:00:22.439 --> 00:00:24.649
of being treated
 unfairly by police.

00:00:24.649 --> 00:00:27.569
A black man has twice
 the odds of being pulled over

00:00:27.569 --> 00:00:28.778
compared to a white man.

00:00:28.778 --> 00:00:30.697
To say, “I can't breathe”,

00:00:30.697 --> 00:00:32.699
it's not as though he
didn't try to communicate.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:35.660
What is it gon’ take?

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:37.203
I'm mad as hell!

00:00:39.789 --> 00:00:42.083
Today's political climate
 has carried on the tradition

00:00:42.083 --> 00:00:44.127
of protecting those
 who have been accused

00:00:44.127 --> 00:00:45.837
of excessive use of force.

00:00:45.837 --> 00:00:47.589
Don't be too nice.

00:00:50.175 --> 00:00:51.217
I'll tell you what
freedom is to me.

00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:52.844
No fear!

00:00:53.970 --> 00:00:55.722
There have been
more protests than

00:00:55.722 --> 00:00:57.724
the whole last
period of civil rights.

00:00:59.768 --> 00:01:02.562
It's not enough to just watch it
 and be upset about it.

00:01:04.314 --> 00:01:06.483
We have to come up
 with a solution. 

00:01:07.901 --> 00:01:10.361
We look at what the community
 is asking of us.

00:01:11.946 --> 00:01:13.073
What do we have to lose...

00:01:14.949 --> 00:01:16.576
by actually doing
something different?

00:01:18.787 --> 00:01:20.121
No justice!

00:01:20.121 --> 00:01:21.206
No peace!

00:01:21.206 --> 00:01:22.540
No justice!

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:23.416
No peace!

00:01:23.416 --> 00:01:24.417
No justice!

00:01:24.417 --> 00:01:25.668
No peace!

